# A fetch from a remote that takes 30 s: the app shows it is busy, a second mutation is refused
# while it runs (the pointer moves away after each click, because the button hover color differs), and Esc cancels the fetch. The spinner never stops, so its cells are ignored.
fixture slow-remote
wait text "chore: initial commit"
ignore 125 1 35 1
click 53 1
wait text "Fet"
move 100 30
snapshot fetching
click 86 1
move 100 30
snapshot stash-while-busy
key esc
snapshot cancelled
